      "Aries": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Aries, it tends to work in a quick, direct, and bold way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is nerve, plain speech, and quick recovery, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that speed can outrun listening or an important detail, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine without turning it into a race.",
      "Taurus": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Taurus, it tends to work in a steady, sensual, and dependable way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is patience, a good eye for quality, and reliable follow-through, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that comfort can become inertia, and a settled view can resist new facts, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine slowly enough for the result to last.",
      "Gemini": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Gemini, it tends to work in a curious, mobile, and questioning way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is curiosity, quick links between ideas, and lively wording, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that attention can scatter, or a clever answer can miss the deeper question, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine and then compare it with one other view.",
      "Cancer": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Cancer, it tends to work in a protective, tender, and memory-led way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is warm memory, careful timing, and protective awareness, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that an old hurt can be stored away, and care can turn into withdrawal, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine in a setting that feels private and safe.",
      "Leo": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Leo, it tends to work in an expressive, proud, and playful way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is generosity, visible confidence, and the ability to make an effort joyful, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that pride can take feedback personally or crowd out quieter voices, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine with room for play and honest credit.",
      "Virgo": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Virgo, it tends to work in a precise, observant, and improvement-minded way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is early fault-spotting, order, and a practical method, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that the wish to improve can become overchecking or fault-finding, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine one detail at a time.",
      "Libra": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Libra, it tends to work in a graceful, fair, and relationship-aware way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is tact, a fair hearing for both sides, and ease in cooperation, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that peacekeeping can delay a clear answer or give other opinions too much weight, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine after hearing your own preference clearly.",
      "Scorpio": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Scorpio, it tends to work in an intense, private, and probing way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is staying power, close attention, and loyalty where trust is earned, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that privacy can become secrecy, testing, or scorekeeping, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine with no hidden test attached.",
      "Sagittarius": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Sagittarius, it tends to work in an expansive, candid, and horizon-seeking way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is hope, big-picture thinking, and willingness to try a new route, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that enthusiasm can outrun evidence, details, or another person’s pace, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine while leaving room to revise the plan.",
      "Capricorn": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Capricorn, it tends to work in a measured, responsible, and pragmatic way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is clear priorities, promise-keeping, and respect for slow progress, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that duty can crowd out play, and worth can be tied too tightly to achievement, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine as one step in a longer climb.",
      "Aquarius": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Aquarius, it tends to work in an independent, inventive, and idea-led way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is fresh perspective, inclusion, and an eye for patterns, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that distance can replace participation, or difference can matter more than understanding, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine and say the reason in ordinary words.",
      "Pisces": "Uranus is the part of a chart linked with change, independence, and fresh perspectives. In Pisces, it tends to work in an imaginative, tender, and atmosphere-aware way, especially around routines, groups, and new tools. The easy side is empathy, imagination, and a softening touch, which can make a stale pattern easier to question. The rub is that boundaries can blur, and fantasy or avoidance can hide the next step, especially when a routine asks for patience. A practical step is to test a change on a small scale before overturning a routine and then return to one concrete next step."
